5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>喜欢祭典</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>参加一次竞赛</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>心理学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：精神影响、模因、强迫性、移情作用、记忆影响、知识</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E8%AD%9A.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E8%AD%9A.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>英雄传</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、以具有自我的，外貌类似人类的人型项目为主角的故事</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%AA%B0%E3%81%8B%E3%81%AE%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%AA%B0%E3%81%8B%E3%81%AE%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>某人的日常</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、不包含基金会工作人员的故事</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>周刊杂志</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>一个月内发布4篇以上的文档-<em>就最近这个月:)</em></strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/07.png" width="50" alt="07.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">我浮上来啦！</span>我沉下去啦！</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在加入网站至少三个月后产出的第一篇合格作品<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">获得50+</span>又掉出了50开外</strong></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">作品页自检</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以评分排序</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">快捷链接</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我的代码水平：复制粘贴</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/guide-hub">指导中心</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource">SCP格式资源</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wiki-syntax">Wiki语法</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E6%A0%B7%E7%89%88#pages">样板页</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E7%89%88%E5%BC%8F#pages">版式页</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/advanced-formatting-and-you">你与高级格式</a> · <a href="http://topia.wikidot.com/bhl-preparation-tool">BHL Prep Tool</a></strong></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2021“殴打疯鸽”新人竞赛</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我是新人，我被疯鸽殴打</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="center-collapse"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">留言板</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">欢迎留言</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>如果你有什么想对我说的话可以放在这里，我会回复。当然也欢迎私信！可能会不定期清空留言板，所以请务必随意<span class="ruby">编辑<span class="rt">瞎 搞</span></span>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Keyest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" >Keyest</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>怎麼能如此高產呢？新人競賽有這麼一個競爭對手真的壓力山大啊！我也要加把勁了，恭喜！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wupaispanda" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5223229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Wupaispanda" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5223229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wupaispanda" >Wupaispanda</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>大概因为我是短篇写手…wupa的两篇文实在太长了导致我一直没看真是对不起，谢罪.jpg</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>同是新人，为什么你这么厉害？（哀嚎）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xanarchy-militia" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6910500&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="XANARCHY MILITIA" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6910500)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xanarchy-militia" >XANARCHY MILITIA</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>不厉害，我爬（。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>中分作者页最速传说！！赶紧留个言，可惜没占到第一 期待你之后的更多作品！加油啊，黑键jpg ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedreamkiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5064505&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="TheDreamKiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5064505)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedreamkiller" >TheDreamKiller</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>你也搞快点，Dr.唐的人设我还等着看呢。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>猛地发现星凌up了你的人事（双重含义）<span style="color: white">（此处可能道歉QwQ）</span>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Frozen starry sky" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" >Frozen starry sky</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>这竟然是我发布的第一个没被星凌d的界面，不胜荣幸！<span style="color: white">回白字：不，其实我不介意的，觉得文档不符合标准的时候就应该d。当然如果能留下改进意见就更好啦。</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>是怪物新人！我爱了爱了——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="BruceWu0463" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" >BruceWu0463</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>没有没有，我写得像屎（。）前辈什么时候开个二阶段稿楼啊！</p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>二阶段只有半个月了还有稿楼的必要吗.jpg——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>与之相比我就是一条真正的咸鱼。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>前辈不要说笑了，上过精品的作者怎么能叫咸鱼（。</p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>你记错了吧，我没上过精品。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>会不会以为你的李家庄上精了（——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>我记错了。太丢人了我爬！！</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>本来没想留言，但好像是第一次看到用留言板互动的形式，之前看到的都是别人单方面留言而作者什么也不说。这种互动形式真的有意思，一下子没忍住就。截至目前键斯特绝对可以说是高产高质量作者，与之相比我就是一条真正的咸鱼.jpg——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>说来好笑，其实我是因为不喜欢评论区互动刷板，但是又觉得不回复诸位不太好，所以才设了留言板（。）这么一看效果还不错，欢迎大家以后继续和我留言板互动！</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>与之相比我就是一条真正的咸鱼。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4915183&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="hoah2333" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4915183)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" >hoah2333</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>诸位前辈别硼了，人都被硼傻了，我一会就把这页归档。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;&#32;这是用来复制的留言格式。——[[*user&#32;你的ID]]</span></p> </blockquote> <hr /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="display:none"> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-250264-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 俗称金枪鱼。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-250264-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 图片来源见此：<a href="https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/">https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/</a> 。使用pixabay授权协议。</div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188747" alt="Keyest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" >Keyest</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
