				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) center no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 2px #000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;AtKinの作者頁&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ff5c48&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:100%;&quot;&gt;歡迎你，訪問者&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;页面总览&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-00b84cc21ed6a6ddeb997c817e84f2c2&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;yui-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Page.one&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;翻译作品&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b01&quot;&gt;Burn the house down - by &lt;em&gt;AJR&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:70%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://y.music.163.com/m/song?id=1310022241&amp;amp;userid=3394372909&amp;amp;app_version=8.0.20&quot;&gt;Here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Used to keep it cool,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Used to be a fool,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;All about the bounce in my step,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Watch it on the news,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Whatcha gonna do?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;I could hit refresh and forget,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Used to keep it cool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Should I keep it light?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Stay out of the fight?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;No one&#039;s gonna listen to me,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;If I write a song,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Preaching what is wrong,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Will they let me sing on TV?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Should I keep it light?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Is that right?&lt;/p&gt;
