&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP - 译成日期 - 原作者&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5246&quot;&gt;SCP-5246&lt;/a&gt; - 24 Nov 2020 - by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sasarpillsa&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5318713&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609188749&quot; alt=&quot;sasarpillsa&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5318713)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sasarpillsa&quot;  &gt;sasarpillsa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
