						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>標題：</strong>闇壽司 中心頁<br /> <strong>作者：</strong> ©︎闇壽司有識者會議</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">第一回有識者會議參加者一覧</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">關閉</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-kudo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6198158&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="Dr_Kudo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6198158)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-kudo" >Dr_Kudo</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2081491&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="FattyAcid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2081491)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" >FattyAcid</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meshiochislash" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526847&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="meshiochislash" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526847)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meshiochislash" >meshiochislash</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tateito" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6719937&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="tateito" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6719937)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tateito" >tateito</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2206092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="tutuji" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2206092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" >tutuji</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kumer1090" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4268967&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="kumer1090" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4268967)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kumer1090" >kumer1090</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/sushiblade-hub/%E6%81%8B%E6%98%8F%E5%B4%8E%E5%BA%97%E5%BA%97%E4%B8%BBwith%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E3%83%AB/medium.jpg" width="300px" alt="medium.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>光臨！！！歡迎來到闇壽司戀昏崎店！</p> <p>Oh！客人你對闇壽司有興趣嗎？</p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉你、你在講啥？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>裝傻也沒有用哦。人家從你身上感到闇的氣息了呢。</p> <p>如果你想離開的話，先吃掉這堆油魚才能走喔。</p> <p>怎樣，是不是想知道闇壽司了？</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉好、好的</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>Welcome！那人家告訴你闇壽司的事喔。</p> <p>這裡你可以隨意看看。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-5d5b13c9b2560df9cddc68fc1c781371" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>菜單</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司檔案</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司陀螺玩家</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司圖錄</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>闇壽司檔案格式</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>力量的使用法</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>●闇之記錄</strong></p> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1644-jp">SCP-1644-JP</a> 著：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2081491&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="FattyAcid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2081491)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" >FattyAcid</a></span></li> </ul> <p><strong>●闇之傳言</strong></p> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushiblade">新節目「握飯降臨　壽司陀螺」</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-3-2-1-hey-rassyai">最終話前加長版特別節目『回憶中的壽司陀螺！覺醒的三文猛魚！』</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2206092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="tutuji" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2206092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" >tutuji</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/tasty-lunch-1">戶神司 午飯的主義 前編</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" s