kidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4589204)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mitan" >Mitan</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/egg-drago">黃金的左旋轉，魔蛋龍！</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205804&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="yzkrt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205804)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" >yzkrt</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/django">續・荒野的迪亞哥</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4549537&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="VideoGameMonkeyMONO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4549537)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" >VideoGameMonkeyMONO</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-go-round-or-spining-sushi">回ㄓㄨㄢˇ寿司，还是回ㄓㄨㄢˋ寿司。</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-cal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3383689&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="k-cal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3383689)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-cal" >k-cal</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kyoudainokizuna">兄弟之情，破碎吧闇之寒冰！</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ty2" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6116771&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="ty2" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6116771)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ty2" >ty2</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dark-and-deity">闇與神</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2081491&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="FattyAcid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2081491)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" >FattyAcid</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shironose-kuzira-1">白乃瀨鯨的人間三昧</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carbon13" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3442755&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="carbon13" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3442755)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carbon13" >carbon13</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scum-splatter-and-spin">渣滓！飛濺！回轉！</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span></li> </ul> <p><strong>●不同角度的闇</strong></p> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/koigarezaki-news-911-1998-ver">曼哈頓維度崩潰 GOC或將立刻介入</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stengan774" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5644609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="stengan774" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5644609)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stengan774" >stengan774</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spc-034-jp">SPC-034-JP - 地下都市“Zagin”</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205804&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="yzkrt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205804)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" >yzkrt</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/koigarezaki-news-20160827">國際奧委會拒絕奧組委請求 東京奧運舉辦成未知數</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/critter-profile-shigastan">小動物簡介：Sigastan！</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stengan774" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5644609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="stengan774" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5644609)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stengan774" >stengan774</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ambrose-shigastan">安布羅斯餐廳西加斯坦分店</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoday" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2802497&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="apoday" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2802497)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoday" >apoday</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/u-z-4000-z-4000">&quot;甚平陀螺&quot;販賣信息</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4549537&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="VideoGameMonkeyMONO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4549537)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" >VideoGameMonkeyMONO</a></span></li> </ul> <p><strong>●闇之繪卷</strong></p> <p><strong>●國際闇飯醉組織</strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.003</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no003" target="_blank">鯛堡</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;鯛堡&quot;是無迴轉者的壽司陀螺，某種意義上也可說是野生壽司的鯛魚握飯。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.007</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">LSD壽司</a></span></h1> <p>其為將致幻劑固化的食材。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.021</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">酪梨蝦</a></span></h1> <p>知曉酪梨與壽司的相合性，為歐美風壽司的代表。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.033</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">量產型鯛堡</a></span></h1> <p>由於養殖技術的發達，重現鯛堡的研究成功了。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.033<span style="color: red">-D</span></span></h2> <h1><span><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no033-d" target="_blank">貨車</a></span></span></h1> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">貨車是具有主要用來搬運貨物的裝貨台之車輛。</span></p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.038</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-case-file-nihira" target="_blank">假幣握飯</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;假幣握飯&quot;是指稱由闇壽司協助，以特定的怪異憑依於食材的壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.039</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">壓力的佃煮軍艦</a></span></h1> <p>將壓力作為軍艦壽司的食材捏握，為概念握飯之一。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.041</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no041" target="_blank">手裏劍</a></span></h1> <p>手裏劍為箱壽司壓縮加工後的一種型態。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.042</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no042" target="_blank">加州卷</a></span></h1> <p>加州卷這個名稱並非是給特定食材，其是基於形狀或料理方式所分類的。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.052</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no052" target="_blank">磁道砲</a></span></h1> <p>磁道砲是將物體以洛倫茲力加速，並發射出去的裝置。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.053</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-053" target="_blank">紅豆軍艦</a></span></h1> <p>紅豆軍艦是起源於香港的一種當地壽司，主要以醋飯、海苔以及混合蛋黃醬蒸煮的紅豆沙所構成。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.058</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no058" target="_blank">劣食壽司</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;劣食壽司&quot;一般是指不熟練的壽司職人所作，作得很差的壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.064</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no064" target="_blank">失傳壽司</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;失傳壽司&quot;是因為什麼理由而丟失了捏握技術，於不久後其存在也被忘記的壽司總稱。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.073</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no073" target="_blank">原初之壽司</a></span></h1> <p>首個被捏握、厌恶、浸渍的&quot;壽司&quot;之形，其實力是如何呢。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.086</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no086" target="_blank">生火腿壽司</a></span></h1> <p>生火腿壽司是從生火腿塊切取少量的生火腿，並盛放在醋飯之上的壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.089<span style="color: red">-D</span></span></h2> <h1><span><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no033-d" target="_blank">炸彈握飯</a></span></span></h1> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">能用大砲直接向對手投擲的壽司陀螺。</span></p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.096</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">金槍鰹魚壽司主義</a></span></h1> <p>左手是究極金槍，右手是炙燒焦糖鰹。以漁夫的態疊加中誕生！這就是我的金槍鰹魚&quot;壽司&quot;主義噠ッッッ！！</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.098</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">凱撒沙拉</a></span></h1> <p>凱撒沙拉可說是那位凱撒所愛過的壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.107</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">瀧太郎</a></span></h1> <p>全長3m的巨大魚類，以UMA壽司而言是入門款。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.110</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no110" target="_blank">槍械</a></span></h1> <p>槍械，指的是以火藥等將稱為子彈的飛行體發射出去的裝置總稱。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.118</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no118" target="_blank">二重身</a></span></h1> <p>二重身是自古以來流傳的超常現象之一。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.157</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no157" target="_blank">麻辣拉麵</a></span></h1> <p>麻辣拉麵是使用了辣椒及山椒、特徵為麻辣味的拉麵。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.221</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">帕秋莉·諾蕾基（眼鏡）</a></span></h1> <p>其運用厄爾瑪聖印奇術所作出。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.233</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no233" target="_blank">简体字卷</a></span></h1> <p>使用中国大陆所用的简体汉字，为概念握饭的一种形态。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.280</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">特拉亞博士</a></span></h1> <p>「就是我自身成為壽司這件事」</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.303</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no303" target="_blank">奇哥</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;奇哥&quot;是一種壽司形態，為一個壽司包著從外表無法預測的要素。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.333</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no333" target="_blank">狀態握飯</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;狀態握飯&quot;為將人類或物體的&quot;狀態&quot;作為食材的壽司總稱。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.401</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">酸辣湯麵</a></span></h1> <p>將表現酸味的&quot;酸&quot;加上&quot;辣&quot;，兩者兼備的拉麵。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.403</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no403" target="_blank">握把柄</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;握把柄&quot;為將人類&quot;弱小&quot;的記憶作為食材使用的握壽司總稱。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.422</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">大王烏賊握飯</a></span></h1> <p>以馬里亞納海溝的探索所供應的大王烏賊作握壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.499</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no499" target="_blank">墨魚汁意麵</a></span></h1> <p>墨魚汁意麵是將烏賊汁作為醬汁使用、威尼斯代表的意麵料理。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.514</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">和平握飯</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;夜鷹機關&quot;餘黨所使用的概念壽司，能展開將各種武器無效化的壽司氣場。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.555</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/can-you-feel-yamizushi-file-555" target="_blank">音軌#55： Can You Feel？ / 你可感受到？</a></span></h1> <p><em>Can You Feel？來說說小星星吧</em></p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.795<span style="color: red">-D</span></span></h2> <h1><span><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no795-d">地球</a></span></span></h1> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">地球是孕育包括人類的多個生命的，太陽系的行星。</span></p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.872</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no872" target="_blank">歐戈波戈</a></span></h1> <p>歐戈波戈(Ogopogo)是在加拿大不列顛哥倫比亞省的奧卡納干湖目擊到的未確認生物(UMA)。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.876</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no876" target="_blank">Salmon Ride</a></span></h1> <p>雖然本體為碟形終端，但回轉時會從終端出現具有質量的幻影。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.911</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no911" target="_blank">廣末孝行的半敲</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;廣末孝行的半敲&quot;為使用（省略）廣末孝行作概念握飯的一種形態。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.986</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">煙燻生火腿握飯</a></span></h1> <p>使用煙燻的生火腿的壽司陀螺。除了有很香的味道外跟生火腿壽司沒啥特別不同。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.1000</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000" target="_blank">非迴轉壽司</a></span></h1> <p>&quot;非迴轉壽司&quot;是&quot;非迴轉壽司協會&quot;的臼倉膳座會長所使用的壽司。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.1012</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1012" target="_blank">德式酸菜</a></span></h1> <p>德式酸菜是將高麗菜給這樣那樣加上酸味的德國料理。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.1500</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="javascript:;">普十麦握飯</a></span></h1> <p>將居住於四川省阿垻自治州的龍人們的語言作為食材的握飯。</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: #000000"> <h2><span>No.縺ゅ′繧�</span></h2> <h1><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-noxyz" target="_blank">黑洞</a></span></h1> <p>黑洞為有非常高的密度的天體。</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><strong>・老大</strong></span></p> <ul> <li><strong>闇（SCP-1134-JP-a）</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司的老大。精通各種邪道壽司，僅僅追求強大的男人。原本的名字為阿榮，從前和親哥哥阿勝一起進行過壽司陀螺的修煉，作為壽司師傅的手藝也相當不錯。然而，苦苦修煉的手藝被斥為邪道，最終墮入闇側。對他人姓名毫不在意，但似乎對哥哥阿勝和弟子們有一點點感情。使用的壽司陀螺有拉麵，炸雞塊、蛋糕等種類繁多。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1134-jp">SCP-1134-JP</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-3-2-1-hey-rassyai">最終話前加長版特別節目『回憶中的壽司陀螺！覺醒的三文猛魚！』</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-dotera">穿著褞袍的客人</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-battle-round01">闇比賽</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/egg-drago">黃金的左旋轉，魔蛋龍！</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-encounter-match">遭遇戰・糺之森</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dark-and-deity">闇與神</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sb-ibunden">爆天握飯：壽司陀螺　異聞傳</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no042">闇壽司檔案No.042 &quot;加州卷&quot;</a><br /> <a target="_blank" href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-noxyz">闇壽司檔案No.縺ゅ′繧� &quot;黑洞&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no003">闇壽司檔案No.003 &quot;鯛堡&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no064">闇壽司檔案No.064 &quot;失傳壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/itamae-yami">壽司職人溶入黑暗</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no499">闇壽司檔案No.499 &quot;墨魚汁意麵&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no058">闇壽司檔案No.058 &quot;劣食壽司&quot;</a>（提及）<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1710-jp-j">SCP-1710-JP-J</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knife">妖菜刀貝爾</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no073">闇壽司檔案No.073 &quot;原初之壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/complete-dark">完全的闇</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no041">闇壽司檔案No.041 &quot;手裏劍&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1779-jp">SCP-1779-JP</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shironose-kuzira-3">白乃瀨胡太郎的人間犯罪</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no052">闇壽司檔案No.052 &quot;磁道砲&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no110">闇壽司檔案No.110 &quot;槍械&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-infiltrators">碟中諜</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/she-will-dance-with-the-dark">壽司職人與闇共舞</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-blacklist-008">謝絕入店名單No.008 &quot;麥當娜·莉莉&quot;</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no795-d">闇壽司檔案No.795-D &quot;地球&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/third-raw">第三壽司</a></p> </blockquote> <p><br /></p> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><strong>・壽司暗黑卿</strong></span></p> <ul> <li><strong>服務員</strong></li> </ul> <p>高級餐廳“弟弟的食品店”的服務員。其真實身份為壽司暗黑卿。與播磨權十郎有孽緣。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nostalgic-taste">令人懷念的味道</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>路貝圖斯 睦美（闇壽司戀昏崎店店主）</strong></li> </ul> <p>在戀昏崎開店的闇壽司店主。只使用油魚壽司的可怕闇壽司陀螺玩家。攜帶著槍械火器。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jet-black">不見五指的黑暗</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kanshin-ryoiki-koigarezaki">國內特別關注區域：戀昏崎</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no911">闇壽司檔案No.911 &quot;廣末孝行的半敲&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no064">闇壽司檔案No.064 &quot;失傳壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yone-blade">米津元帥迴轉壽司秘譚</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/koigarezaki-news-20190415">NHK与超常社会矛盾激化</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no086">闇壽司檔案No.086 &quot;生火腿壽司&quot;</a>（提及)</p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>御蓮寺戀治</strong></li> </ul> <p>自稱是闇壽司暗黑卿。其輕視客人的信念及傳統等，僅渴望著壽司陀螺的勝利。不過多少還有著無法狠下心來的一面。興趣是遊戲。經常被逐出闇壽司。也是麥當娜·莉莉的弟子。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no058">闇壽司檔案No.058 &quot;劣食壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no303">闇壽司檔案No.303 &quot;奇哥&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no033-d">闇壽司檔案No.033-D &quot;貨車&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no333">闇壽司檔案No.333 &quot;狀態握飯&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/koigarezaki-news-20200908">信新告發文 現任知事使用禁止米的疑雲</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no118">闇壽司No.118 &quot;二重身&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/end-of-the-sushi">正常與異常的寿司</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-blacklist-008">謝絕入店名單No.008 &quot;麥當娜·莉莉&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>嘎・嘎</strong></li> </ul> <p>壽司暗黑卿。以異常延長壽命，已經活了400年以上。使用以LSD壽司進行自我暗示、自我洗腦的手法，使對自身的認知變為宇宙怪獸，並能轉動地球的樣子。對羅馬教皇等人抱持復仇心。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no795-d">闇壽司No.795-D &quot;地球&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <p><br /></p> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><strong>・闇壽司四菜刀</strong></span></p> <ul> <li><strong>肉菜刀阿石</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司四菜刀之一。擅長使用肉壽司的闇壽司陀螺玩家，甚至會使用人肉壽司。有武人性格，對闇壽司高度忠誠。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scum-splatter-and-spin">渣滓！飛濺！回轉！</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knif">妖菜刀貝爾</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>出刃菜刀阿弱</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司四菜刀之一。其為調查壽司跟心的關聯性的研究者，在精神醋飯浸漬等方面很優秀。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/vinegared-rice-brainwashing-orientation">精神醋飯浸漬新人指導</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no064">闇壽司檔案No.064 &quot;失傳壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knife">妖菜刀貝爾</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>隠菜刀阿祟</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司四菜刀之一。實力很弱會用卑鄙手段，但其為努力家，上進心也很強。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/itamae-yami">*itamae-yami 壽司職人溶入黑暗</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knife">妖菜刀貝爾</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no157">闇壽司No.157 &quot;麻辣拉麵&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no872">闇壽司No.872 &quot;歐戈波戈&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no033-d">闇壽司No.033-D &quot;貨車&quot;</a>（提及）<br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/she-will-dance-with-the-dark">壽司職人與闇共舞</a>（提及）</p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>瑞士刀歐路拉</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司四菜刀之一。於身上纏著的黑色披風底下，隱藏著80%替換成機械的身體，具備右手的壽司發射器等各式各樣的武器以及器具。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knife">妖菜刀貝爾</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>妖菜刀貝爾</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇壽司四菜刀之一。使用塗了血的菜刀的少女。執著於讓自身踏入闇道的凱。本名是貝爾娜黛特。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/bernadetta-the-ghostly-knife">妖菜刀貝爾</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yamizushi-file-no1000">闇壽司檔案No.1000 &quot;非回轉壽司&quot;</a></p> </blockquote> <p><br /></p> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><strong>・成員</strong></span></p> <ul> <li><strong>豬頭男</strong></li> </ul> <p>被漢堡肉的力量所侵蝕，頭部化作豬頭的男人。平常帶著兜帽遮蓋住臉。心狠手辣，對攻擊對方玩家本人毫不猶豫。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1134-jp">SCP-1134-JP</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushiblade">新節目「握飯降臨　壽司陀螺」</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-battle-round01">闇比賽</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dark-and-deity">闇與神</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>假面男</strong></li> </ul> <p>多次阻擋龍的闇壽司陀螺玩家。其真實身份為曾經的No.1壽司陀螺玩家，同時是阿勝的同志，也是龍的父親。與阿勝共同開發的新壽司陀螺被“非回轉壽司協會”認定為邪道，最終墮入闇壽司。是龍的夥伴三文猛魚的設計者。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-3-2-1-hey-rassyai">最終話前加長版特別節目『回憶中的壽司陀螺！覺醒的三文猛魚！』</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>Sushi Dark</strong></li> </ul> <p>對壽司社會十分熟稔的神秘人物。化名Sushi Dark，懷疑與闇壽司有關。似乎在對壽司材料與壽司陀螺玩家進行研究。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/critter-profile-shigastan">小動物簡介：Sigastan！</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ambrose-shigastan">安布羅斯餐廳西加斯坦分店</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>安格爾·道格拉斯</strong></li> </ul> <p>支配瘋洲地下城的闇大師。冷酷且滴水不漏，會準備人質及其他殺招以作為後路。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/django">續・荒野的迪亞哥</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>樫漬</strong></li> </ul> <p>闇大師之一。能夠自由操縱闇之力量。利用精神醋飯浸漬用醃金槍魚企圖讓西行墮入闇側。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-go-round-or-spining-sushi">回ㄓㄨㄢˇ寿司，还是回ㄓㄨㄢˋ寿司。</a></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><strong>多良場可兒</strong></li> </ul> <p>東京某個高級壽司店地下競技場的主人。使用特殊對戰規則“限定戰”滿足觀眾。被壽司學院使出的水針魚刺穿頭部當場死亡。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>出演作品</strong><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shironose-kuzira-1">白乃瀨鯨的人間三昧</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p>闇壽司所使用的壽司陀螺沒有名字，也不會與使用者間產生羈絆，因此誰都可以使用。</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th colspan="2">名稱</th> <th>特徵</th> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">香腸</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">炸雞塊</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">加州捲</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">五花肉</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">蛋糕</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">生火腿</td> <td>　</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">油魚</td> <td>闇壽司戀昏崎店店主的油魚能夠發出全身是刺的惡鬼一樣的聖靈。</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">漢堡肉</td> <td>肉的重量將會產生強大的破壞力。使用普通壽司很難打倒。</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">玉米蛋黃醬沙拉</td> <td>縱向回轉。</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">拉麵</td> <td>破壞力極大，甚至能夠粉碎人類肋骨令內臟破裂。發射時不使用筷子，而是使用湯勺夾住。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>↳</td> <td>竹岡式拉麵</td> <td>千葉的本土拉麵。不使用高湯，只用醬油調味，其湯底可謂是闇本身。</td> </tr> </table> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p>引入以下代碼，就能使用闇壽司的專用主題。</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">@import&#32;url(&quot;//scp-jp-sandbox3.wikidot.com/draft:2206092-11-d84a/code/1&quot;);</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">@import&#32;url(&quot;//scp-jp-sandbox3.wikidot.com/draft:2206092-11-d84a/code/1&quot;);</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">#page-content&#32;.rate-box-with-credit-button&#32;.creditButton&#32;{</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;background-color:&#32;rgb(102,&#32;102,&#32;102);</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;border:&#32;1px&#32;solid&#32;rgb(102,&#32;102,&#32;102);</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">}</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">#page-content&#32;.rate-box-with-credit-button&#32;.creditButton:hover&#32;{</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;background-color:&#32;rgb(113,&#32;113,&#32;113);</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;border:&#32;1px&#32;solid&#32;rgb(113,&#32;113,&#32;113);</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">}</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">#page-content&#32;.rate-box-with-credit-button&#32;.creditButton&#32;a:hover&#32;{</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;color:&#32;white;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">}</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">#page-content&#32;.modalbox&#32;.printuser&#32;a&#32;{</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;color:&#32;#b01;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">}</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">#page-content&#32;.modalbox&#32;h2&#32;{</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;color:&#32;black;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">}</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> </blockquote> <p>闇壽司的標準格式如下。</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[size&#32;120%]]**概論**[[/size]]</span></p> <p>（關於項目的概要描述）</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[size&#32;120%]]**壽司陀螺運用**[[/size]]</span></p> <p>（項目在作為壽司陀螺使用時的特徵以及戰術相關描述）</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[size&#32;120%]]**其它活用方式**[[/size]]</span></p> <p>（關於項目在壽司陀螺以外的使用方法描述）</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[size&#32;120%]]**軼事**[[/size]]</span><br /> （與項目相關的軼事描述）</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[size&#32;120%]]**相關資料**&#32;[[/size]]</span></p> <p>（如果沒有可連接文章的時候）<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[#&#32;資料名稱]</span><br /> 資料解說</p> <p>(有可連接文章的時候)<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[連接網址&#32;資料名稱]</span><br /> 資料解說</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[&gt;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">文責：（任意人名）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/&gt;]]</span></p> </blockquote> <p>另外在&quot;壽司陀螺運用&quot;一項中能插入雷達圖表。標準圓形雷達圖表描述如下。</p> <p>輸出例子</p> <div style="overflow: hidden;"> <div class="circle-1 circle-left sushi"> <div class="graph-box"> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> </div> <div class="scale-box"> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> </div> <div class="line-box"> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> </div> <div class="label-box"> <div class="label"> <p>H</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>A</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>B</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>S</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>C</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>D</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>{$label7}</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>{$label8}</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>{$label9}</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>{$label10}</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[div&#32;style=&quot;overflow:&#32;hidden;&quot;]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:fes-ryuukatetu:include-list:radar-chart</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|no=1&#32;（在一篇文章內使用多個圖表的時候，請分別變更此數字）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|item=6&#32;（表目數）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|size=250px&#32;(圖表大小）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|max=10&#32;（表目數值在圖表上的最大值）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data1=10&#32;（此處開始為表目數值）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data2=1</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data3=10</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data4=1</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data5=10</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|data6=1</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label1=H&#32;（此處開始為表目名稱）</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label2=A</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label3=B</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label4=S</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label5=C</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|label6=D</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/div]]</span></p> </blockquote> <p>如想知道詳細的使用方法以及雙重圖表版、多角形版，請參照雷達圖表作者<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fes-ryuukatetu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4577911&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="FeS_ryuukatetu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4577911)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fes-ryuukatetu" >FeS_ryuukatetu</a></span>的<a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/author:fes-ryuukatetu">作者頁</a>。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <p>闇壽司是壽司師傅失去矜持，染指闇之力墮入邪道形成的壽司店GoI。他們為了勝利不擇手段，會使用邪道壽司材料甚至拉麵，對玩家本人造成傷害，還會進行洗腦。</p> <p>基金會在<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1134-jp">SCP-1134-JP</a>發現了闇壽司的存在，並將其編號為GoI-8134。基金會未獲得太多有關闇壽司的情報，目前還在調查之中。</p> <hr /> <p>原本是與壽司陀螺相關的GoI，但你可以寫與壽司陀螺無關的闇壽司文檔。<br /> 搜索標籤“闇寿司”可以看到闇壽司相關的SCP文檔與故事。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushiblade-hub">👉與闇壽司對抗</a></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188752" alt="M Element" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" >M Element</a></span></p> 
