><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1318-jp">SCP-1318-JP</a></td> <td>マーメイド・アニサキス</td> <td>人鱼异尖线虫</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2768562&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="AMADAI" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2768562)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" >AMADAI</a></span></td> <td>梦见科技</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>梦见科技，我以前没有见过这个GoI……调查进行了快四个月，很多之前没听过的组织都渐渐浮出水面来了，是这样吗……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1333-jp">SCP-1333-JP</a></td> <td>いびき消し薬</td> <td>打鼾消除药</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3346860&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="noyama" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3346860)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" >noyama</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我从来没听说过打呼噜还能招来虫子。<br /> 不过，雇这个人作为基金会的特工，也许是个好主意……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1590-jp">SCP-1590-JP</a></td> <td>フェアトレードコーヒー</td> <td>公平贸易咖啡</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这已经是第几个涉及冻雾的项目了？时间线上没有的东西也开始出现了，到底该怎么修改……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1964-jp">SCP-1964-JP</a></td> <td>かえるの歌が聞こえてくるよ</td> <td>听得到青蛙唱歌哦</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3345869&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="Karatema" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3345869)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" >Karatema</a></span></td> <td>东弊重工</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>东弊的东西应该没问题，日创的似乎也……不过这两个加一起就不能叫没问题了。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1806-jp">SCP-1806-JP</a></td> <td>勅瀬研究員の受難</td> <td>敕濑研究员的受难</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2788230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="atrs_lg" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2788230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" >atrs_lg</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>忽然想到了《庄子》里面写的：“嗟乎！夫造物者又将以予为此拘拘也。”<br /> 当然了这帮家伙可不能叫做造物者。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1919-jp">SCP-1919-JP</a></td> <td>下品なジョーロ</td> <td>低劣的喷壶</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2577572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="SOYA-001" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2577572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" >SOYA-001</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>好心办坏事还害死了自己的村民，简直没有什么比这种事情更伤一个老人的心了……这群[脏话删除]混蛋难道不是拿他们做实验体了吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1979-jp">SCP-1979-JP</a></td> <td>たけのこの山</td> <td>竹笋山</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3389120&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="WagnasCousin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3389120)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" >WagnasCousin</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这个……很想看看他们说的“更花哨的玩意”是什么。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1033-jp">SCP-1033-JP</a></td> <td>ヴァーチュアル・ラビット</td> <td>虚拟兔子</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/furabbit" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3198079&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="furabbit" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3198079)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/furabbit" >furabbit</a></span></td> <td>imaginanimal</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这里面的那起事件虽然说闹了大半天，不过似乎结局倒是兔八哥式的结尾……虽然说假如当事人是个小孩子会更完美一些。<br /> 哦，我觉得他大概也忘了那天是他的生日。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1060-jp">SCP-1060-JP</a></td> <td>トーローカマキリ</td> <td>莫名之螳</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2979568&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="regifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2979568)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" >regifu</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我可不觉得看着别人死有多好笑。<br /> 另外那个俗语，螳臂当车吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1259-jp">SCP-1259-JP</a></td> <td>地獄の沙汰も金次第</td> <td>有钱能使鬼推磨</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/o-92-mallet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129932&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609188754" alt="O-92_Mallet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129932)" /></a><a href=